<title>CHINA: Tianjin Automobile gains permission for expansion.</title>
<headline>Tianjin Automobile gains permission for expansion.</headline>
<dateline>TIANJIN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tianjin Automobile Industrial Co. Ltd has received official approval for an expansion project worth 2.1 billion yuan (253 million US dollars), Xinhua news agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The agency said the project was aimed at expanding production of the Charade compact car.</p>
<p>Tianjin Automobile currently has annual production volume of 150,000 vehicles, second in China only to Shanghai Volkswagen, it said.</p>
<p>The agency gave no details.</p>
</text>
